== 4. a plain-HTTP registry is refused rather than downgraded
  exit 1
    podbox: "http://registry.invalid/library/archlinux:latest" names http://, and registry.invalid is not configured as an insecure registry. podbox does not downgrade a connection on its own: tcp/80 is black-holed on the runtimes podbox targets, so an automatic fallback hangs rather than failing (T-0201). Permit it deliberately with `--insecure-registry registry.invalid`, with $PODBOX_INSECURE_REGISTRIES, or with a line in the registries config file: podbox speaks HTTPS only and will not downgrade. tcp/80 egress is broken on the runtime podbox targets, so a plain-HTTP fallback hangs instead of failing (TODO/image.md T-0201)
